  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Edit users in Capium 365\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  4:27 PM\n\n\t\tManaging your team efficiently is key to smooth operations in any accounting practice. Capium 365 makes it easy to edit user details, update roles, and control access levels—all in just a few clicks. In this guide, we’ll walk you through the simple steps to edit users in Capium 365. \n\nCapium 365\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > User\n\nThere are 2 ways you can edit your users in capium 365:\n\nBy clicking on the users 'ID'\nBy clicking on the 'Pen' icon next to the user\n\nID\n\nFirstly, click on the 'ID' number next to the user you wish to edit. This will open the user details, allowing you to make the necessary changes.  \n\nPen Icon\n\nFirst, click on the 'Pen Icon' next to the user you wish to edit. This will open the user details, allowing you to make the necessary changes. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
